/**
 * Brand artwork as inline SVG, for `SvgXml` from react-native-svg.
 *
 * Generated from `apps/mobile/assets/baraka-icon.svg` (the crescent mark) and
 * `apps/mobile/assets/baraka-logo.svg` (the "baraka stories" wordmark).
 * Regenerate rather than hand-edit.
 *
 * Two croppings of each, because they are wanted for different jobs:
 *
 * - **full** keeps the original 1500x1500 canvas. Both files share it, which is
 *   what lets the splash animation line the standalone mark up exactly with the
 *   crescent inside the wordmark.
 * - **tight** crops the canvas to the drawn artwork. That is what any ordinary
 *   piece of UI wants, since the full canvas is mostly empty space that would
 *   otherwise have to be laid out around.
 *
 * Fills are white in the source and tinted on use, so one copy serves every
 * colour the app needs.
 */

